---
import { Container } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import HomeHeroSection from '../components/sections/heros/HomeHeroSection.astro';
import settings from '../config/settings.js';
---

<!-- seo explícito: un solo <title> desde settings (evita ambigüedad con caché / meta) -->
<Layout seo={{ title: settings.title, description: settings.description }}>
	<HomeHeroSection />
	<Container>
		<div class="tevsys-home-band tevsys-home-band--cards">
			<div class="tevsys-home-mid-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<section class="feature-card__section">
			<h2 class="feature-section__title">¿Cuánto dinero has perdido por no parar a tiempo?</h2>
			<p class="feature-section__hook">Sin excusas. Las buenas intenciones no cierran ni bloquean operaciones. Nosotros sí.</p>
			<p class="feature-card__intro-trazabilidad">Trazabilidad completa: logs y reporte oficial MT5.</p>
			<p class="feature-card__intro-mecanismo">Configuras una vez. Ejecutamos siempre. Incluso los días que tú decides estar OFF.</p>
			<p class="feature-card__intro-ellos"><span class="feature-hook__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Ellos deslizan. En tevsys cerramos.</p>
			<div class="feature-card__grid">
				<a href="/features/precision" class="tevsys-card">
					<span class="tevsys-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					<div class="tevsys-card__image">
						<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/home/cards/card-1-input.webp" /><img src="/assets/images/home/cards/card-1-input.png" alt="0,06% error medio" width="640" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
					</div>
					<div class="tevsys-card__content">
						<div class="tevsys-card__title-row">
							<h3><span class="card-title__accent">0,06%</span> error medio</h3>
							<span class="tevsys-card__saber-mas">Saber más</span>
						</div>
						<p class="feature-card__hook">¿Has sentido que tu Stop Loss te cerró en otro planeta? — tevsys te lo cuenta todo.</p>
						<p>Ajuste en tiempo real: volatilidad • spread • slippage • comisiones</p>
						<p>65 operativas documentadas. Validado en 5 entornos de ejecución.</p>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a href="/features/hyperclose" class="tevsys-card">
					<span class="tevsys-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					<div class="tevsys-card__image">
						<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/home/cards/card-2-hyperclose.webp" /><img src="/assets/images/home/cards/card-2-hyperclose.png" alt="HyperClose" width="640" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
					</div>
					<div class="tevsys-card__content">
						<div class="tevsys-card__title-row">
							<h3><span class="card-title__accent">HyperClose</span></h3>
							<span class="tevsys-card__saber-mas">Saber más</span>
						</div>
						<p class="feature-card__hook">La diferencia entre querer parar y no poder seguir.</p>
						<p>Intentas operar bloqueado, HyperClose cierra en milisegundos.</p>
						<p>Cada intento queda registrado. También en días OFF.</p>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a href="/features/sml" class="tevsys-card">
					<span class="tevsys-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					<div class="tevsys-card__image">
						<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/home/cards/card-3-sml.webp" /><img src="/assets/images/home/cards/card-3-sml.png" alt="SML Smart Money Lock" width="640" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
					</div>
					<div class="tevsys-card__content">
						<div class="tevsys-card__title-row">
							<h3><span class="card-title__accent">SML</span> — Smart Money Lock</h3>
							<span class="tevsys-card__saber-mas">Saber más</span>
						</div>
						<p class="feature-card__hook">No es obligatorio. Es una recompensa.</p>
						<p>Actívalo cuando quieras • Amplías margen 5%-25% (mín. 75% protegido)</p>
						<p>Conserva lo ganado. Convive con límites y días OFF.</p>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a href="/features/evidencia" class="tevsys-card">
					<span class="tevsys-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					<div class="tevsys-card__image">
						<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/home/cards/card-4-evidencia.webp" /><img src="/assets/images/home/cards/card-4-evidencia.png" alt="Evidencia verificable" width="640" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
					</div>
					<div class="tevsys-card__content">
						<div class="tevsys-card__title-row">
							<h3><span class="card-title__accent">Evidencia</span> verificable</h3>
							<span class="tevsys-card__saber-mas">Saber más</span>
						</div>
						<p class="feature-card__hook">No confíes: Comprueba.</p>
						<p class="feature-card__evidence-case"><strong>Caso real:</strong> 100.000 € · 20 lotes · Apertura Wall Street.</p>
						<p class="feature-card__evidence-stat">Error al cierre: <span class="feature-card__evidence-stat-value">0,0072 %</span></p>
						<p class="feature-card__evidence-proofline">Vídeo del cierre · Informe MT5 · Historial de transacciones.</p>
						<p class="feature-card__evidence-close">Todo descargable. Todo verificable.</p>
						<p class="feature-card__whisper">El desafío está servido. Para ti o para quien te audite.</p>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>
		</div>
	</Container>
	<div class="tevsys-home-band tevsys-home-band--lower">
		<div class="tevsys-home-lower-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<Container>
		<section class="plans-section">
			<h2 class="plans-section__title">Elige tu cuenta</h2>
			<p class="plans-section__subtitle">Elige tu cuenta y te guiamos paso a paso. Essential ya está en demo/beta; Advanced y Pro están en acceso anticipado.</p>
			<div class="plans-grid">
				<article class="plan-card">
					<div class="plan-card__image">
						<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/plans/essential-card.webp" /><img src="/assets/images/plans/essential-card.png" alt="Plan Essential" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
					</div>
					<div class="plan-card__content">
						<h3><span class="card-title__accent">Essential</span></h3>
						<ul class="plan-card__bullets plan-card__bullets--aperitivo" aria-label="Resumen Essential">
							<li><strong>Disciplina automatizada</strong> y <strong>gestión de riesgo</strong> con los límites que tú configuras.</li>
							<li>Cierre de altísima precisión · bloqueo hasta rotación.</li>
							<li><strong>HyperClose</strong> · bloqueado o límite tocado: un intento de operar → cierre inmediato.</li>
							<li>Días OFF y rotación diaria (un día activo).</li>
							<li>Noticias y horarios · cuando estén listas.</li>
						</ul>
						<p class="plan-card__aperitivo-footer">Demo disponible · detalle y condiciones en <a href="/precios#essential">Precios</a></p>
						{settings.checkoutEssentialReady ? (
							<div class="plan-card__cta-row">
								<a href="/precios#essential" class="plan-card__cta plan-card__cta--primary">Comprar Essential</a>
								<a href="/company/contact?plan=essential" class="plan-card__cta plan-card__cta--secondary">Probar demo</a>
							</div>
						) : (
							<a href="/company/contact?plan=essential" class="plan-card__cta">Elegir Essential</a>
						)}
					</div>
				</article>
				<article class="plan-card">
					<div class="plan-card__image">
						<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/plans/advanced-card.webp" /><img src="/assets/images/plans/advanced-card.png" alt="Plan Advanced" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
					</div>
					<div class="plan-card__content">
						<h3><span class="card-title__accent">Advanced</span></h3>
						<p>En Advanced ofrecemos todo lo de Essential, además: protección configurable toda la semana, SML y días OFF. En desarrollo — lista de espera.</p>
						<a href="/company/contact?plan=advanced" class="plan-card__cta">Elegir Advanced</a>
					</div>
				</article>
				<article class="plan-card">
					<div class="plan-card__image">
						<picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/plans/pro-card.webp" /><img src="/assets/images/plans/pro-card.png" alt="Plan Pro" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
					</div>
					<div class="plan-card__content">
						<h3><span class="card-title__accent">Pro</span></h3>
						<p>En Pro ofrecemos todo lo de Advanced, además: drawdown y estructura completa para capitales más altos. En desarrollo — lista de espera.</p>
						<a href="/company/contact?plan=pro" class="plan-card__cta">Elegir Pro</a>
					</div>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>
		</Container>
		<section class="founder-section">
		<Container>
			<div class="founder-message">
				<p class="founder-claim"><span class="founder-tevsys">tevsys</span> no es el sueño de un inversor. Es la respuesta de un trader.</p>
				<blockquote>
					"Nadie me enseñó a gestionar el riesgo ni la disciplina. Tuve que inventar algo que me obligara a cumplir mis límites. <span class="founder-tevsys">tevsys</span> es eso: lo que me faltaba entonces, ahora para todos."
				</blockquote>
				<p class="founder-signature">— Gabi, fundador de tevsys</p>
			</div>
		</Container>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.feature-card__section {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
	}
	.feature-section__title {
		font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.feature-section__hook {
		font-size: 1rem;
		opacity: 0.92;
		margin-top: 0;
	}
	/* Estilo micropáginas: punto amarillo + texto gris (hereda) */
	.feature-card__intro-ellos {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-style: italic;
		font-weight: 600;
		opacity: 0.9;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 0;
	}
	.feature-card__intro-ellos .feature-hook__dot {
		width: 0.45rem;
		height: 0.45rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #f5b041;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}
	.feature-card__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: var(--theme-grid-gap);
	}
	.tevsys-card {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		background-color: var(--theme-surface-1);
		color: var(--theme-on-surface-1);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		text-decoration: none;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
	}
	.tevsys-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.45);
		box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.2), 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
		transform: translateY(-3px);
	}
	.tevsys-card__arrow {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 1rem;
		right: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		opacity: 0.45;
		transition: opacity 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
	}
	.tevsys-card:hover .tevsys-card__arrow {
		opacity: 1;
		color: #f5b041;
		transform: scale(1.2);
	}
	.tevsys-card__image {
		aspect-ratio: 16/10;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.tevsys-card__image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
	}
	.tevsys-card__content {
		padding: 1.25rem;
	}
	.tevsys-card__title-row {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.tevsys-card__title-row h3 {
		margin: 0;
		flex: 1;
		min-width: 0;
	}
	.tevsys-card__saber-mas {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		opacity: 0;
		transition: opacity 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, background-color 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
		color: inherit;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		background-color: transparent;
	}
	.tevsys-card:hover .tevsys-card__saber-mas {
		opacity: 0.9;
		border-color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 35%, transparent);
		background-color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 8%, transparent);
	}
	.tevsys-card__content p {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.tevsys-card__content p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.card-title__accent {
		font-weight: 700;
		transition: color 0.25s ease;
	}
	.tevsys-card:hover .card-title__accent,
	.plan-card:hover .card-title__accent {
		animation: card-title-blink 1.4s ease-out forwards;
	}
	@keyframes card-title-blink {
		0% { color: var(--theme-on-surface-1); }
		25% { color: #f5b041; }
		50% { color: var(--theme-on-surface-1); }
		75% { color: #f5b041; }
		100% { color: #f5b041; }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.tevsys-card:hover .card-title__accent,
		.plan-card:hover .card-title__accent {
			animation: none;
			color: #f5b041;
		}
	}
	.feature-card__hook {
		font-style: italic;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	.feature-card__whisper {
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}
	/* Card Evidencia — jerarquía (caso / dato / medios / cierre) */
	.tevsys-card__content .feature-card__evidence-case,
	.tevsys-card__content .feature-card__evidence-stat,
	.tevsys-card__content .feature-card__evidence-proofline {
		margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
	}
	.tevsys-card__content .feature-card__evidence-case {
		opacity: 0.95;
	}
	.tevsys-card__content .feature-card__evidence-stat {
		margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.feature-card__evidence-stat-value {
		color: #f5b041;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.tevsys-card__content .feature-card__evidence-proofline {
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	.tevsys-card__content .feature-card__evidence-close {
		margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
		font-weight: 600;
		opacity: 0.92;
	}
	.plans-section {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
	}
	.plans-section__title {
		font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, sans-serif;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}
	.plans-section__subtitle {
		margin-top: 0;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}
	.plans-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: var(--theme-grid-gap);
	}
	.plan-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		height: 100%;
		background-color: var(--theme-surface-1);
		border-radius: var(--theme-shape-radius);
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		cursor: default;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
	}
	.plan-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.4);
		box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.2), 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
		transform: translateY(-3px);
	}
	.plan-card__image {
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: #06080d;
	}
	.plan-card__image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: contain;
	}
	.plan-card__content {
		padding: 1rem 1.1rem 1.2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		flex: 1;
	}
	.plan-card__content h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
	}
	.plan-card__content p {
		margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
	}
	.plan-card__bullets--aperitivo {
		margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
		padding-left: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}
	.plan-card__bullets--aperitivo li {
		margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
	}
	.plan-card__bullets--aperitivo li:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.plan-card__aperitivo-footer {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
		opacity: 0.82;
	}
	.plan-card__aperitivo-footer a {
		color: #f5b041;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.plan-card__aperitivo-footer a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
	.plan-card__content > a.plan-card__cta {
		margin-top: auto;
	}
	.plan-card__cta-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-top: auto;
	}
	.plan-card__cta-row .plan-card__cta {
		width: 100%;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.plan-card__cta {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0.48rem 0.95rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
		background: #f5b041;
		color: #1a1510;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
	}
	.plan-card__cta:hover {
		background: #f7c050;
	}
	.plan-card__cta--primary {
		background: #f5b041;
		color: #1a1510;
	}
	.plan-card__cta--primary:hover {
		background: #f7c050;
	}
	.plan-card__cta--secondary {
		background: transparent;
		color: inherit;
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.6);
	}
	.plan-card__cta--secondary:hover {
		border-color: #f5b041;
		background: rgba(245, 176, 65, 0.12);
	}
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.feature-card__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.plans-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
	.founder-section {
		margin: var(--section-margin) auto;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}
	.founder-claim {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		color: var(--theme-primary);
	}
	.founder-tevsys {
		color: #f5b041;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.founder-message blockquote {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-style: italic;
		margin: 2rem 0;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	.founder-signature {
		font-size: 1rem;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}
</style>
